content.fix_description:
Added a response interceptor in frontend/src/lib/api-client.ts that checks for the { data, meta } envelope and unwraps it before any caller sees the response:

  apiClient.interceptors.response.use((res) => {
    if (res.data && Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(res.data, 'data')) {
      res.data = res.data.data;
    }
    return res;
  }, ...);

Also fixed the raw axios.post in the refresh-token path (which bypasses apiClient interceptors) to manually unwrap: reads envelope.data instead of data directly.
